From 45a1cf6fc1e5a84e01fcc5f3d3e4d3666d0e18e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMB-1 FM6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:48:50 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] 1.3.97: the reel, one track of tape (11.8 s) with
 Morphagene-like genes

- app/dsp/reel.c: mono, 22.05 kHz, IMA ADPCM in blocks of 256 (each with the coder's state: read anywhere, either
  way); SOURCE the mix (the reel left out), a voice alone or the pulse; up to 8 splices, a new one at the end (EDIT on
  the reel's pages) or the one ORGANIZE picks overdubbed sound on sound (REC, SOS); played as up to four genes: GENE,
  SLIDE, SPEED (-2x .. stop .. +2x, wow and flutter), MORPH (gaps, joined, overlapping, spread, octaves)
- the Tape and Gene pages (SEQ again, and again); SAVE there keeps the reel in the flash (0xA7000), loaded at the
  start; REC held erases it; MIDI CC 50..57 on channel 16; the dice on both pages
- room for it: the plate's lines in 16 bits (as it sounded: rms 0.0792 against 0.0791), the echo's tape 2.8 s
- project format 10 (format 9 carried over as it is)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
